# Motion study (an extension): a parameter w drives a rectangle's side;
# Analyze > Motion Study drives w from 30 to 60 in three steps, listing
# whether each solved, then again saving a mesh of each step.
key r
move 200 200
down L 200 200
up L 200 200
move 380 330
down L 380 330
up L 380 330
key esc
menu Edit|Parameters...
twmove 51 130
twdown L 51 130
twup L 51 130
edit w = 30
move 290 330
down L 290 330
up L 290 330
key d
key esc
move 290 370
down L 290 370
up L 290 370
down L 290 370
dbl L 290 370
up L 290 370
edit w
key x shift
menu Assembly|Motion Study...
tw
twmove 159 165
twdown L 159 165
twup L 159 165
edit 3
twmove 42 195
twdown L 42 195
twup L 42 195
tw
file $tmp/frame.stl
twmove 114 195
twdown L 114 195
twup L 114 195
tw
menu Edit|Parameters...
tw
